      "Source": "ai:public-caiyun",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextWrapped"
    },
    {
      "Original": "in your dresser, can move to the armoire",
      "Translated": "在你的梳妆台上，可以移到衣橱里",
      "Context": "MainWindow.DrawHighlightLegend",
      "Source": "ai:public-caiyun",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextWrapped"
    },
    {
      "Original": "in bags / armoury / saddlebag / retainer, can move to the armoire",
      "Translated": "放在包/军械库/边箱/固定器中，可以移动到衣橱",
      "Context": "MainWindow.DrawHighlightLegend",
      "Source": "ai:public-caiyun",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextWrapped"
    },
    {
      "Original": "would complete a partial dresser set if put into the dresser",
      "Translated": "如果放入梳妆台，将完成部分梳妆台套装",
      "Context": "MainWindow.DrawHighlightLegend",
      "Source": "ai:public-caiyun",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextWrapped"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Your saddlebag wasn't readable when you scanned, which happens in instances and until you open it. Anything in it may be missing from the lists below, so open the saddlebag once and scan again.",
