      "Context": "MainWindow.DrawSaddlebagUnavailableBanner",
      "Source": "ai:public-caiyun",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextColored"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Open the Armoire once this session to load stored-item data. Until then, items already in the armoire may show in the lists below.",
      "Translated": "在此会话中打开衣橱一次以加载存储的物品数据。在此之前，衣橱中已有的物品可能会显示在下面的列表中。",
